            "review_title": "Review at Sakuraya Sushi",
            "review_text": "Daydream30370436361\n2 contributions\n0\nGreat\nSep 2026 • Friends\nMust-try spot for Japanese food lovers! 🍣✨\n\nI recently visited Sakura Ya and was thoroughly impressed from start to finish.\n\nThe highlight of the night was definitely the sashimi. The raw fish was incredibly fresh, sweet, and expertly sliced. The presentation was gorgeous, and you could immediately tell how much care went into selecting the ingredients.\n\nWhat made the experience even better was the warm hospitality. The staff were exceptionally welcoming, attentive, and professional throughout our meal. They paid attention to every small detail without being intrusive.\n\nExcellent food paired with top-tier service—I will definitely be coming back soon!\nRead more\nWritten September 8, 2026",
